 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Inalla: Wizards' Council",
 "notes": [
  "Inalla works from the command zone: whenever another nontoken Wizard enters, pay {1} for a hasty token copy, even if she's never cast. She also has a Final Fantasy printing as Kuja, Mage Manufacturer.",
  "Copies don't count as cast, so 'if you cast it' and converge effects don't double: Radiant Epicure's token drains 0, and Puppeteer Clique's does work. Note the difference when playing.",
  "Plan: keep {1} open on every Wizard. Hasty tokens tap the same turn, so Azami draws off them and Inalla's tap-five ability drains 7 sooner than it looks.",
  "Conjurer's Closet re-enters a Wizard each end step, giving a second copy every turn.",
  "Estimated, not simulated: wins around turns 8–10, with drain in repeated 7s and pingers from Mysidian Elder and Kuja tokens. Early stabilization is good: 5 bounce or removal bodies, 5 removal spells and 4 counters, though creatures are small.",
  "Left out on purpose: Thassa's Oracle (Game Changer), Dualcaster Mage (Twinflame-style infinites) and Ghostly Flicker (loops with Archaeomancer).",
  "Rares and mythics to pick up or check your binder for: Archmage Emeritus; Azami, Lady of Scrolls; Baral, Chief of Compliance; Blasphemous Act; Chaos Warp; Conjurer's Closet; Docent of Perfection; Ertai Resurrected; Exotic Orchard; Fabled Passage; Kuja, Genome Sorcerer; Naban, Dean of Iteration; Puppeteer Clique; Temple of Deceit; Temple of Epiphany; Temple of Malice; Tishana's Tidebinder",
  "Commons and uncommons to pick up or check your binder for: Adeliz, the Cinder Wind; Aether Adept; Archaeomancer; Basalt Ravager; Cloudkin Seer; Command Tower; Crumbling Necropolis; Cyclops Electromancer; Dimir Aqueduct; Evolving Wilds; Exclusion Mage; Faerie Seer; Faller's Faithful; Firefist Adept; Frost Trickster; Ghitu Journeymage; Go for the Throat; Izzet Boilerworks; Izzet Chronarch; Lightning Greaves; Merfolk Trickster; Mind Stone; Mysidian Elder; Omenspeaker; Path of Ancestry; Ponder; Preordain; Radiant Epicure; Rakdos Carnarium; Reliquary Tower; Riverwise Augur; Sage of Fables; Scholar of the Ages; Sea Gate Oracle; Serum Visionary; Sparkmage Apprentice; Stonybrook Banneret; Swiftfoot Boots; Terminate; Terramorphic Expanse; Trinket Mage; Unclaimed Territory; Viashino Pyromancer; Wizard Class; Wizard's Lightning; Wizard's Retort",
  "Hobbit or Lord of the Rings commons and uncommons you likely have from half displays: Gandalf, Spark Starter"
 ],
